{"3782750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "拾光犬物语", "steam_appid": 3782750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《拾光犬物语》是一款休闲探索收集游戏。您可以操作狗狗在小镇的大街小巷探索，收集各种稀有收藏品。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782750/extras/458d47d483a518399023358aaef85d71.avif?t=1778811665\" width=866 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在一片被暖阳与绿荫环抱的土地上，坐落着一座名为 “拾光镇” 的奇妙小镇。生活在小镇中的狗狗们各个都是收藏家，探索小镇收集稀有收藏品的同时，逐渐了解狗狗们过去的故事。这是一个连风都裹挟着温馨的地方，每一寸土地都记录着人们与狗狗之间的温情故事。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782750/extras/c64147df7a4d0395b42bdefe45cd22f5.avif?t=1778811665\" width=866 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在小镇的大街小巷尽情探索，成为狗狗收藏家！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782750/extras/0c8e931609ceeaa523748112aa91a7b1.avif?t=1778811665\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782750/extras_big/0c8e931609ceeaa523748112aa91a7b1.avif?t=1778811665 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >超多超有梗的稀有收藏品等你收集！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782750/extras/503dae6fb2acc46a70c2529ea9ccfec6.avif?t=1778811665\" width=1560 height=1754 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782750/extras/44f44757edf92677e6b4a5630e5ec5ac.avif?t=1778811665\" width=866 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >剧情+解密温情时刻：主线+支线多种解密元素融入场景和剧情，超多NPC，感受人与动物的温情瞬间！</p